Requirements:

1. Technical SEO
- Generate and configure sitemap.xml
- Generate robots.txt
- Add canonical URLs to all pages
- Ensure all important pages are indexable
- Remove duplicate metadata issues
- Fix broken internal links
- Use clean SEO-friendly URLs
- Add proper redirects where necessary

2. Metadata Optimization
- Add dynamic metadata for every page
- Optimize:
  - title
  - meta description
  - Open Graph tags
  - Twitter cards
- Ensure unique metadata per page
- Add proper favicon and social preview support

3. Next.js Optimization
- Use App Router best practices
- Use SSR, SSG, or ISR where appropriate
- Avoid unnecessary client-side rendering
- Optimize hydration performance
- Optimize bundle size
- Enable caching strategies where useful

4. Performance Optimization
- Improve Lighthouse SEO and Performance scores
- Optimize Largest Contentful Paint (LCP)
- Optimize Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS)
- Optimize First Input Delay (FID/INP)
- Lazy load non-critical content
- Optimize fonts and assets
- Compress and optimize images
- Use next/image correctly

5. Semantic HTML & Accessibility
- Replace non-semantic structures with semantic HTML
- Ensure proper heading hierarchy (h1-h6)
- Add alt text to all images
- Improve accessibility and ARIA support
- Ensure keyboard navigation support

6. Structured Data
- Add Schema.org structured data where appropriate:
  - Product
  - Article
  - Organization
  - Breadcrumb
  - FAQ
  - LocalBusiness
- Validate structured data implementation

7. Content Structure
- Improve internal linking
- Ensure proper heading structure
- Optimize content readability
- Remove thin or duplicate content
- Improve crawlability

8. Mobile Optimization
- Ensure fully responsive mobile-first design
- Optimize touch interactions
- Optimize mobile performance

9. Deliverables
- Refactor the codebase directly
- Explain all SEO improvements made
